      "description": "This is the old steam plant.  It is a historical landmark.  ZymoGenetics a biotech company bought and occupied the building before being acquired by Bristol Myers Squibb.  You can see the smoke stacks from the freeway.  They were replaces with smaller light weight stacks.  For a while the company name was written down the stacks as shown in the right most one.\n\nThe road over the water was rebuilt recently.  We visited for the opening celebration.",
